* B1 BEH-CON-DCJACK contact drop and self-heating at 2.5 A (CUI PJ-102A rev 1.07: 24 V, 2.5 A, 30 mohm)
* Rth ASSUMPTION: 30 K rise at rated current. alpha 0.0039/K ASSUMPTION (copper-alloy contact)
.param I=2.5 R0=30m alpha=0.0039 Rth={30/(I*I*R0)}
Is 0 n {I}
Rcon n 0 {R0}
Bp 0 t I = {I*I*R0}*(1+{alpha}*v(t))
Rt t 0 {Rth}
.control
op
print v(n) v(t)
let e_v = 2.5*30e-3
let e_dt = 30/(1-0.0039*30)
let e_p = 2.5*2.5*30e-3
print e_v e_dt e_p
.endc
.end
